# IMX round 2: the part destinations of the synth automation on Tracker+ through the stock synth part path (core/AudioEngine/partAuto.h, the
# kAuto source of audioEngine::updateSynthAuto). plus_flows.sh writes the store from the poke file: 7 s after the pattern screen Pan +40 and
# Reverb send +30 on Synth 1, 2 s later both off. The console boot runs about 6 s past the first pattern screen and the audio callback
# (engine.update) only runs from the replay's advances on (--wav), so earlier pokes would come and go before any audio block. The flow waits through both.
# Ends on the poke read (UISHOT_TRACE_PARTAUTO): Synth 1's Pan and Reverb send moved by +40 and +30 with the mask 5, then came back to the base
title: Part destinations on Tracker+ (IMX round 3)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

wait 1500ms
tap Pattern
wait 1500ms
shot partauto-on
wait 2500ms
shot partauto-off
